# Vercel AI Gateway key for AI PM chat streaming (S19+).
# On Vercel deploys this is auto-provisioned via OIDC and is NOT required.
# For `next dev` locally, get a key from Vercel dashboard → AI Gateway → API Keys
# (or run `vercel env pull` to pull a short-lived OIDC token).
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=""
